\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces Original-label examples illustrating the main pipeline's capacitor-name consolidation. A source class-1 \emph  {Capacitor Jumper} example and a source class-2 \emph  {Capacitor} example map to canonical class 0. Each before/after pair uses the same image and coordinates. This is a task-level taxonomy decision, not proof that every source instance is correctly annotated. The original-label paper-comparison track deliberately excludes source class 1.\relax }}{6}{figure.6}\protected@file@percent }
